      "message": "It\u0027s probably caused by `CompatOnBackInvokedCallback` that directly enqueue the `back key` into the `ViewRootImpl` and the target view will check the focus state in a short stage.\n\nOne simple solution is to re-inject the `back key` to `InputManager` if no focus set, so the focus and key dispatching could be handled by input framework (included ANR handling).",
